It serves as a continuation of the HBO television series Sex and the City (1998–2004), and follows the lives of four close friends— Carrie Bradshaw (Sarah Jessica Parker), Samantha Jones (Kim
Cattrall), Charlotte York Goldenblatt (Kristin Davis), and Miranda Hobbes (Cynthia Nixon)—as they navigate relationships, careers, and personal challenges in New York City.

14
